| 15a | AFTER, ahead of rank 16 | `K7` the re-cut, per-document units under a house manifest (one moved page moves one unit id, an import of one face's units lands that face alone; `bundle-manifest.ts`, `commands/house-bundle.ts`, `rite-keep.ts`), then `K8` the sealed unit, cleartext to the operator's own hands and sealed past them (`packages/lares-cli/src/keep-seal.ts`) | The keep must stand whole before `L35` burns the flat store, since the daemon wiki then holds the only copy of every session's memory. |

